PGs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~15 Hour Campaign:</strong> A focused story-driven adventure without filler or bloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visible Encounters:</strong> No random battles- see enemies on the field and choose when to engage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Turn-Based Combat:\u00a0</strong>Battles feature fast, turn-based combat with a clear move queue for strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard Break System</strong>: Hit enemy weaknesses to break their guard and leave them vulnerable for the rest of the fight.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sudden Kebab Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/header.jpg?t=1762457516","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324590/1898526852/6b70b3baaf74d55bac79c1e783f2f0b1ba8c6900/1750870137/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747232575","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324590/1898526852/6b70b3baaf74d55bac79c1e783f2f0b1ba8c6900/1750870137/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747232575","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324590/1898526852/6b70b3baaf74d55bac79c1e783f2f0b1ba8c6900/1750870137/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747232575","id":257139690,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139690/95637bcfbbafac9dc70a42fcdb24cd77289dfc61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747232575"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324590/795047/01f320464a93858a03e244ed4b5ded1973d690c7/1750870137/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738140007","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324590/795047/01f320464a93858a03e244ed4b5ded1973d690c7/1750870137/dash_h264.mpd?t=1738140007","highlight":true,"h